# ── Parts — 6 mixed parts per bin (2 cubes, 2 tubes, 2 L-tubes) ─────
# Bin-frame layout with GENEROUS spacing (a packed layout interpenetrated at
# load and MuJoCo ejected the overlapping L-tubes metres away), rotated by
# each bin's yaw. Tubes spawn UPRIGHT and topple during the settle (a capsule
# standing on its round cap is unstable), so contents land in fresh poses.
